  "totalBlocks": 64,
  "translatedBlocks": 64,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b42198d093a825c4",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我会向你展示我是如何制作 Doodle Dash 的。这是一款由机器学习驱动的实时网页游戏，完全在你的浏览器中运行（这要归功于 Transformers.js）。本教程旨在向你展示，制作自己的机器学习网页游戏有多么简单……正好赶上即将到来的 Open Source AI Game Jam（2023 年 7 月 7 日至 9 日）。如果你还没报名，那就来参加这次游戏创作活动吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3cbfe44ebc2194d2",
      "translationZh": "快捷链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "123c0ba0b3837c3f",
      "translationZh": "演示：Doodle Dash",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64ee470dff5338a3",
      "translationZh": "源代码：doodle-dash",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f45768049fe0104",
      "translationZh": "参加游戏创作活动：Open Source AI Game Jam",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d4b1ea5708dd5329",
      "translationZh": "概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96995fac02087528",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，我们先来聊聊要制作什么。这款游戏的灵感来自 Google 的 Quick, Draw! 游戏：游戏会给你一个词，神经网络有 20 秒时间来猜测你在画什么（重复 6 次）。事实上，我们会使用他们的训练数据来训练自己的草图识别模型！开源是不是很让人喜欢？😍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a189236ee210f5e1",
      "translationZh": "在我们的版本中，你有一分钟时间，要根据每次给出的一个提示，尽可能多地画出物品。如果模型预测出了正确的标签，画布就会被清空，你也会得到一个新词。不断重复，直到计时结束！由于游戏在你的浏览器中本地运行，我们完全不必担心服务器延迟。模型能在你绘画的同时进行实时预测，速度高达每秒 60 多次预测……🤯 哇！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c057dfbf8113af2",
      "translationZh": "本教程分为 3 个部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a07f3a4b07ec1dcc",
      "translationZh": "训练神经网络",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cfc3d41279095a91",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers.js 在浏览器中运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "095f9cb81c21d194",
      "translationZh": "游戏设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9d48a147052bdd02",
      "translationZh": "1. 训练神经网络",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "acef4e991a0b6417",
      "translationZh": "训练数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d25b66492525062",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 Google 的 Quick, Draw! 数据集的一个子集来训练模型，该数据集包含超过 500 万幅绘画，涵盖 345 个类别。以下是该数据集中的一些样本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce6c73d3bd20cce7",
      "translationZh": "模型架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78a446a758ce1d32",
      "translationZh": "我们将对 apple/mobilevit-small 进行微调，这是一款轻量级、适合移动端的 Vision Transformer，已在 ImageNet-1k 上完成预训练。它仅有 5.6M 个参数（文件大小约为 20 MB），是在浏览器中运行的理想选择！如需了解更多信息，请参阅 MobileViT 论文及下方的模型架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d153bca4766762a1",
      "translationZh": "微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d599d05938ce69dc",
      "translationZh": "为了让这篇博文保持（相对）简短，我们准备了一个 Colab 笔记本，向你展示我们在自己的数据集上微调 apple/mobilevit-small 的具体步骤。总体而言，这包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4961e0a2fb54390a",
      "translationZh": "加载“Quick, Draw!”数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "502c01cce3f8e4bb",
      "translationZh": "使用 MobileViTImageProcessor 对数据集进行转换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82d522fdddd1890e",
      "translationZh": "定义我们的批次整理函数和评估指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35aae108fa3bc9cf",
      "translationZh": "使用 MobileViTForImageClassification.from_pretrained 加载预训练的 MobileVIT 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69fbe1fbcafc7180",
      "translationZh": "使用 Trainer 和 TrainingArguments 辅助类训练模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b3a69d9af7f2b8d",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 Evaluate 评估模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e97987ecdf2ce7c9",
      "translationZh": "注意：你可以在 Hugging Face Hub 上的此处找到我们微调后的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12334a0338ed127c",
      "translationZh": "2. 使用 Transformers.js 在浏览器中运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "08f0e359062adb3f",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Transformers.js？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "665a73cff070d19b",
      "translationZh": "Transformers.js 是一个 JavaScript 库，让你可以直接在浏览器中运行 🤗 Transformers（无需服务器）！它旨在实现与 Python 库相同的功能，这意味着你可以使用非常相似的 API 运行相同的预训练模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bfa26c747de6195",
      "translationZh": "Transformers.js 底层使用 ONNX Runtime，因此我们需要将微调后的 PyTorch 模型转换为 ONNX。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "030deea85af04147",
      "translationZh": "将我们的模型转换为 ONNX",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "633c86e4d80a96bb",
      "translationZh": "幸运的是，🤗 Optimum 库让你能非常轻松地将微调后的模型转换为 ONNX！最简单（也是推荐）的方法是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb38558829f470d5",
      "translationZh": "克隆 Transformers.js 仓库并安装必要的依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "754dce75d5dfaf08",
      "translationZh": "运行转换脚本（它在底层使用 Optimum）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23fa3d78f44d3b04",
      "translationZh": "其中，<model_id> 是你想要转换的模型名称（例如 Xenova/quickdraw-mobilevit-small）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "57e735a412d69672",
      "translationZh": "搭建我们的项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c99cd5b5d95ce5f5",
      "translationZh": "首先，使用 Vite 搭建一个简单的 React 应用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a37ebbcbf8a55807",
      "translationZh": "接下来，进入项目目录并安装必要的依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a61d78895b34ec95",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以运行以下命令来启动开发服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf400ae4b0b5e5ab",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器中运行模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bd419add2a5be34",
      "translationZh": "运行机器学习模型需要大量计算，因此在单独的线程中执行推理很重要。这样就不会阻塞主线程，而主线程负责渲染 UI 并响应你的绘画手势 😉。Web Workers API 让这一切变得超级简单！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38bfa957aed790cd",
      "translationZh": "在 src 目录中创建一个新文件（例如 worker.js），并添加以下代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d472ab9a6e6749a9",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以在 App.jsx 文件中使用这个 worker，只需将以下代码添加到 App 组件中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "758c08e249f2bfe8",
      "translationZh": "你可以运行开发服务器（使用 npm run dev），访问本地网站（通常是 http://localhost:5173/），并打开浏览器控制台，以测试一切是否正常运行。你应该能看到模型的输出被记录到控制台中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b51c24cdb5fc23b1",
      "translationZh": "太棒了！🥳 虽然上面的代码只是最终产品的一小部分，但它展示了其中的机器学习部分有多么简单！剩下的工作就是让它看起来更漂亮，再添加一些游戏逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca03f29785ca5374",
      "translationZh": "3. 游戏设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0419e7324925d586",
      "translationZh": "在本节中，我会简要介绍游戏设计过程。提醒一下，你可以在 GitHub 上找到这个项目的完整源代码，因此我不会详细讲解代码本身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "644768ea393a7e34",
      "translationZh": "充分利用实时性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f268cbb066ceb547",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器内进行推理的主要优势之一，是我们可以实时进行预测（每秒超过 60 次）。在原版 Quick, Draw! 游戏中，模型每隔几秒才会进行一次新的预测。我们也可以在自己的游戏中采用同样的做法，但那样就没有充分利用它的实时性能了！因此，我决定重新设计游戏的主循环：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa0f5dd234ef5e8c",
      "translationZh": "我们的版本不再采用六轮、每轮 20 秒的形式（每轮对应一个新词），而是要求玩家在 60 秒内尽可能多地正确画出涂鸦（每次给出一个提示词）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05b239d21093a4ac",
      "translationZh": "如果遇到不会画的词，你可以跳过（但这会扣除你剩余时间中的 3 秒）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "903acb05f6a72fb0",
      "translationZh": "在原版游戏中，由于模型每隔几秒才猜测一次，它可以逐渐从列表中排除标签，直到最终猜对。而在我们的版本中，我们会降低模型对前 n 个错误标签的评分；随着用户持续绘画，n 会随时间增大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "990d350f363c91a4",
      "translationZh": "易用性改进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7bdb91fb30b3db3",
      "translationZh": "原始数据集包含 345 个不同的类别，而由于我们的模型相对较小（约 20MB），它有时无法正确猜出其中的一些类别。为了解决这个问题，我们移除了一些符合以下任一情况的词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3252c59a0228a206",
      "translationZh": "与其他标签过于相似（例如，“谷仓”与“房屋”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5e5dc516b9cae3d",
      "translationZh": "过于难以理解（例如，“动物迁徙”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "355c3288ecc1a098",
      "translationZh": "太难画出足够的细节（例如，“brain”，即“大脑”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db32b7b3a1516f71",
      "translationZh": "存在歧义（例如，“bat”既可以指“蝙蝠”，也可以指“球棒”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dda78041a3de96f",
      "translationZh": "筛选之后，我们仍然剩下了 300 多个不同的类别！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8447e5f2fdb74130",
      "translationZh": "彩蛋：给游戏起名字",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47d0eb15cb085a7a",
      "translationZh": "本着开源开发的精神，我决定向 Hugging Chat 征求一些游戏名称的点子……不用说，它果然没有让我失望！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b50e000cf81309e",
      "translationZh": "我喜欢“Doodle Dash”（第 4 个建议）的头韵，所以决定用这个名字。谢谢 Hugging Chat！🤗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c054260ac464f3b5",
